3. Make the Cookie Consent Functional

The cookie consent banner currently provides options such as:

Cookie Settings
Reject Optional
Accept All

These options should perform actual functions instead of being decorative.

Required behaviour:

Accept All: Enable all permitted cookies, including analytics.
Reject Optional: Disable non-essential cookies.
Cookie Settings: Allow users to choose which categories of cookies they want to allow.
Save the user’s selected preference so the banner does not appear repeatedly.
Do not load optional tracking scripts until the user provides consent.
