The Preferred Visit Date field currently allows users to select dates from the past.

Update the booking logic so that:

Past dates cannot be selected.
Unavailable dates cannot be selected.
The earliest available visit date should be at least two days after the current date — T+2.
Available dates and time slots should be clearly displayed.
The same rule should work automatically as the date changes.

Example:

If today is 16 July, the earliest selectable date should be 18 July.

